## Operators & Syntax

### Command Structure

ICEMAN commands follow this general structure:

```
ICEMAN command-name parameters
```

### Common ICEMAN Commands

#### 1. Dataset Commands

```
LISTDATASET
  Purpose: List all datasets on volume
  Syntax: LISTDATASET VOL(VOLUME-NAME)
  
DELETEDATASET
  Purpose: Delete a dataset
  Syntax: DELETEDATASET DATASET(DSN)
  
CREATEDS
  Purpose: Create new dataset
  Syntax: CREATEDS DATASET(DSN)
           TRACKS(primary,secondary)
           BLOCK-SIZE(blk-size)
           RECORD-LENGTH(rec-len)
  
RENAMEDS
  Purpose: Rename dataset
  Syntax: RENAMEDS FROM(old-name) TO(new-name)
```

#### 2. Space Analysis Commands

```
ANALYZE
  Purpose: Analyze disk space usage
  Syntax: ANALYZE VOL(VOLUME-NAME)
          DETAIL FRAGMENTATION
  
REPORT
  Purpose: Generate space report
  Syntax: REPORT VOLUME-SUMMARY
          REPORT DATASET-DETAIL
          REPORT GROWTH-TREND
  
FORECAST
  Purpose: Predict space exhaustion
  Syntax: FORECAST VOL(VOL-NAME)
          MONTHS(12)
          ALERT-THRESHOLD(10%)
```

#### 3. Reorganization Commands

```
REORGANIZE
  Purpose: Defragment dataset
  Syntax: REORGANIZE DATASET(DSN)
          RECLAIM-SPACE
          OPTIMIZE-IO
  
COMPRESS
  Purpose: Compress dataset
  Syntax: COMPRESS DATASET(DSN)
          COMPRESSION-TYPE(RLE)
  
DEFRAG
  Purpose: Defragment volume
  Syntax: DEFRAG VOL(VOLUME-NAME)
          PRIORITY(HIGH)
```

#### 4. Archive Commands

```
ARCHIVE
  Purpose: Archive inactive data
  Syntax: ARCHIVE DATASET(DSN)
          TO-STORAGE-CLASS(ARCHIVE)
          RECALL-ELIGIBLE(YES)
  
RECALL
  Purpose: Recall archived dataset
  Syntax: RECALL DATASET(DSN)
          FROM-ARCHIVE
          PRIORITY(HIGH)
  
MIGRATE
  Purpose: Move to different storage
  Syntax: MIGRATE DATASET(DSN)
          FROM-VOL(OLD-VOL)
          TO-VOL(NEW-VOL)
```

#### 5. Maintenance Commands

```
VERIFY
  Purpose: Verify dataset integrity
  Syntax: VERIFY DATASET(DSN)
          REPAIR-ERRORS
  
BACKUP
  Purpose: Backup dataset
  Syntax: BACKUP DATASET(DSN)
          TO-TAPE
          ENCRYPTION(ON)
  
RESTORE
  Purpose: Restore from backup
  Syntax: RESTORE DATASET(DSN)
          FROM-TAPE
          POINT-IN-TIME(date-time)
```

#### 6. Configuration Commands

```
SET-POLICY
  Purpose: Define retention policy
  Syntax: SET-POLICY DATASET(DSN)
          RETENTION(YEARS(7))
          AUTO-DELETE(YES)
  
SET-THRESHOLD
  Purpose: Set alert threshold
  Syntax: SET-THRESHOLD VOL(VOL-NAME)
          FREE-SPACE(10%)
          ALERT-METHOD(EMAIL)
```

